    "subtitle": "Disequazioni di primo grado con parentesi e frazioni",
    "text": "Risolvi le seguenti disequazioni di primo grado:\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\n\\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=3.2cm]\n    \\item $3(2x - 1) - 4x > 5$\n    \\item $2(3x + 1) - (x - 4) \\leq 7$\n    \\item $3(2x-1)-2(x+4)>5$\n    \\item $5-2(3x-1)\\leq 3(x+2)$\n    \\item $\\dfrac{3x-2}{4}-\\dfrac{x+1}{3}>1$\n    \\item $2-\\dfrac{x-3}{2}\\geq\\dfrac{x+1}{3}$\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $x>4$\n    \\item $x\\leq\\tfrac{1}{5}$\n    \\item $x>4$\n    \\item $x\\geq\\tfrac{1}{9}$\n    \\item $x>\\tfrac{22}{5}$\n    \\item $x\\leq\\tfrac{19}{5}$\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    3(2x-1)-4x &> 5\\\\\n    6x-3-4x &> 5 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{svolgo la parentesi}}\\\\\n    2x &> 8 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{sommo i termini simili e sposto il $-3$}}\\\\\n    x &> 4 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{divido per $2$}}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    2(3x+1)-(x-4) &\\leq 7\\\\\n    6x+2-x+4 &\\leq 7 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{svolgo le parentesi (il meno cambia i segni)}}\\\\\n    5x+6 &\\leq 7\\\\\n    5x &\\leq 1\\\\\n    x &\\leq \\dfrac15 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{divido per $5$}}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    3(2x-1)-2(x+4) &> 5\\\\\n    6x-3-2x-8 &> 5 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{svolgo le parentesi}}\\\\\n    4x-11 &> 5\\\\\n    4x &> 16\\\\\n    x &> 4 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{divido per $4$}}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    5-2(3x-1) &\\leq 3(x+2)\\\\\n    5-6x+2 &\\leq 3x+6 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{svolgo le parentesi}}\\\\\n    -6x-3x &\\leq 6-7 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{porto le $x$ a sinistra e i numeri a destra}}\\\\\n    -9x &\\leq -1\\\\\n    x &\\geq \\dfrac19 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{divido per $-9$: il verso si inverte}}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    \\dfrac{3x-2}{4}-\\dfrac{x+1}{3} &> 1\\\\\n    3(3x-2)-4(x+1) &> 12 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{moltiplico per il m.c.m. $12$}}\\\\\n    9x-6-4x-4 &> 12 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{svolgo le parentesi}}\\\\\n    5x &> 22\\\\\n    x &> \\dfrac{22}{5} && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{divido per $5$}}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    2-\\dfrac{x-3}{2} &\\geq \\dfrac{x+1}{3}\\\\\n    12-3(x-3) &\\geq 2(x+1) && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{moltiplico per il m.c.m. $6$}}\\\\\n    12-3x+9 &\\geq 2x+2 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{svolgo le parentesi}}\\\\\n    -5x &\\geq -19\\\\\n    x &\\leq \\dfrac{19}{5} && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{divido per $-5$: il verso si inverte}}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "id": 213
