    "text": "Risolvi le seguenti equazioni applicando la legge dell'annullamento del prodotto:\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\n\\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=3cm]\n    \\item $(2x+1)(x-5)=0$\n    \\item $(3x-9)(x+4)=0$\n    \\item $(x-2)(4x+8)=0$\n    \\item $(5x-10)(2x+6)=0$\n    \\item $(x+1)(3x-12)=0$\n    \\item $(2x-6)(4x+1)=0$\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $x=-\\tfrac12,\\ 5$\n    \\item $x=3,\\ -4$\n    \\item $x=2,\\ -2$\n    \\item $x=2,\\ -3$\n    \\item $x=-1,\\ 4$\n    \\item $x=3,\\ -\\tfrac14$\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "Si pone uguale a zero ciascun fattore.\n\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $2x+1=0 \\Rightarrow x=-\\tfrac12$; \\quad $x-5=0 \\Rightarrow x=5$.\n    \\item $3x-9=0 \\Rightarrow x=3$; \\quad $x+4=0 \\Rightarrow x=-4$.\n    \\item $x-2=0 \\Rightarrow x=2$; \\quad $4x+8=0 \\Rightarrow x=-2$.\n    \\item $5x-10=0 \\Rightarrow x=2$; \\quad $2x+6=0 \\Rightarrow x=-3$.\n    \\item $x+1=0 \\Rightarrow x=-1$; \\quad $3x-12=0 \\Rightarrow x=4$.\n    \\item $2x-6=0 \\Rightarrow x=3$; \\quad $4x+1=0 \\Rightarrow x=-\\tfrac14$.\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "id": 239
