    "explanation": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    (a-3)(2a^2+1) &= 2a^3+a-6a^2-3\\\\\n    &= 2a^3-6a^2+a-3 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{ordino per grado decrescente}}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    (2m+1)(m^2-4) &= 2m^3-8m+m^2-4\\\\\n    &= 2m^3+m^2-8m-4\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    (2x-1)(x^2+3) &= 2x^3+6x-x^2-3 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{primo prodotto}}\\\\\n    x(-x^2+3) &= -x^3+3x && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{secondo prodotto}}\\\\\n    \\text{somma} &= 2x^3-x^3-x^2+6x+3x-3\\\\\n    &= x^3-x^2+9x-3\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    (y+5)(y^2-y+1) &= y^3-y^2+y+5y^2-5y+5=y^3+4y^2-4y+5\\\\\n    (y+2)(y^2+y-1) &= y^3+y^2-y+2y^2+2y-2=y^3+3y^2+y-2\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    Sottraggo il secondo risultato dal primo (il meno cambia tutti i segni):\n    \\[ y^3+4y^2-4y+5-y^3-3y^2-y+2=y^2-5y+7 \\]\n\\end{enumerate}",
