    "subtitle": "Prodotti notevoli — serie 1",
    "text": "Calcola i seguenti prodotti notevoli:\n\\begin{center}\\begin{minipage}{0.92\\linewidth}\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\n\\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=3.2cm]\n\\item $(a+1)^2$\n\\item $(2a -3)^2$\n\\item $\\Big(\\frac{1}{2}a+\\frac{2}{3}b\\Big)^2$\n\\item $(a-b)^3$\n\\item $(2x - 1 + y)^2$\n\\item $(2a -3)(2a +3) \\color{gray}$\n\\item $\\color{gray} \\Big(\\frac{1}{2}a+\\frac{2}{3}b\\Big)^3 \\color{gray}$\n\\item $\\color{gray} \\Big(\\frac{3}{2}a-\\frac{1}{3}b + c\\Big)^2$\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{multicols}\n\\end{minipage}\\end{center}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $a^2+2a+1$\n    \\item $4a^2-12a+9$\n    \\item $\\tfrac{a^2}{4}+\\tfrac{2ab}{3}+\\tfrac{4b^2}{9}$\n    \\item $a^3-3a^2b+3ab^2-b^3$\n    \\item $4x^2+y^2+1+4xy-4x-2y$\n    \\item $4a^2-9$\n    \\item $\\tfrac{a^3}{8}+\\tfrac{a^2b}{2}+\\tfrac{2ab^2}{3}+\\tfrac{8b^3}{27}$\n    \\item $\\tfrac94a^2+\\tfrac19b^2+c^2-ab+3ac-\\tfrac23bc$\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "Formule dei prodotti notevoli:\n\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(A\\pm B)^2 &= A^2\\pm2AB+B^2 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{quadrato di binomio}}\\\\\n(A+B)(A-B) &= A^2-B^2 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{somma per differenza}}\\\\\n(A\\pm B)^3 &= A^3\\pm3A^2B+3AB^2\\pm B^3 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{cubo di binomio}}\\\\\n(A+B+C)^2 &= A^2+B^2+C^2+2AB+2AC+2BC && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{quadrato di trinomio}}\n\\end{aligned}\\]\n\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item Quadrato di binomio con $A=a$, $B=1$: \\ $a^2+2\\cdot a\\cdot1+1^2=a^2+2a+1$.\n    \\item Con $A=2a$, $B=3$ (segno meno):\n    \\[ (2a)^2-2\\cdot2a\\cdot3+3^2=4a^2-12a+9 \\]\n    \\item Con $A=\\tfrac12a$, $B=\\tfrac23b$:\n    \\[ \\left(\\dfrac12a\\right)^2+2\\cdot\\dfrac12a\\cdot\\dfrac23b+\\left(\\dfrac23b\\right)^2=\\dfrac{a^2}{4}+\\dfrac{2ab}{3}+\\dfrac{4b^2}{9} \\]\n    \\item Cubo di binomio con $A=a$, $B=b$ (segno meno): \\ $a^3-3a^2b+3ab^2-b^3$.\n    \\item Quadrato di trinomio con $A=2x$, $B=-1$, $C=y$: si sommano i tre quadrati e i tre doppi prodotti (attenzione ai segni).\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    &(2x)^2+(-1)^2+y^2 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{quadrati}}\\\\\n    &+2(2x)(-1)+2(2x)(y)+2(-1)(y) && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{doppi prodotti}}\\\\\n    &= 4x^2+1+y^2-4x+4xy-2y\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item Somma per differenza con $A=2a$, $B=3$: \\ $(2a)^2-3^2=4a^2-9$.\n    \\item Cubo di binomio con $A=\\tfrac a2$, $B=\\tfrac{2b}{3}$:\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    A^3 &= \\dfrac{a^3}{8}\\\\\n    3A^2B &= 3\\cdot\\dfrac{a^2}{4}\\cdot\\dfrac{2b}{3}=\\dfrac{a^2b}{2}\\\\\n    3AB^2 &= 3\\cdot\\dfrac a2\\cdot\\dfrac{4b^2}{9}=\\dfrac{2ab^2}{3}\\\\\n    B^3 &= \\dfrac{8b^3}{27}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    Risultato: $\\tfrac{a^3}{8}+\\tfrac{a^2b}{2}+\\tfrac{2ab^2}{3}+\\tfrac{8b^3}{27}$.\n    \\item Quadrato di trinomio con $A=\\tfrac32a$, $B=-\\tfrac13b$, $C=c$:\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    A^2+B^2+C^2 &= \\dfrac94a^2+\\dfrac19b^2+c^2 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{quadrati}}\\\\\n    2AB &= 2\\cdot\\dfrac32a\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac13b\\right)=-ab\\\\\n    2AC &= 2\\cdot\\dfrac32a\\cdot c=3ac\\\\\n    2BC &= 2\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac13b\\right)\\cdot c=-\\dfrac23bc\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    Risultato: $\\tfrac94a^2+\\tfrac19b^2+c^2-ab+3ac-\\tfrac23bc$.\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "id": 263
