    "subtitle": "Sistemi con frazioni in entrambe le equazioni",
    "text": "Risolvi i seguenti sistemi lineari di due equazioni:\r\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\r\n\\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=3.2cm]\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{2x-1}{3}+\\dfrac{y+1}{2}=3\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{2}x-\\dfrac{1}{3}y=0\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{x+y}{2}+\\dfrac{1}{3}x=4\\\\\r\n    x-\\dfrac{1}{3}y=2\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{3x-y}{4}+\\dfrac{1}{2}x=3\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{2}x-\\dfrac{1}{4}y=0\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{2}x-\\dfrac{y-1}{3}=1\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{x+2}{3}-\\dfrac{1}{4}y=1\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\\end{enumerate}\r\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(2,3)$\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(3,3)$\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(4,8)$\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(4,4)$\r\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "\\begin{enumerate}\r\n    \\item Prima per $6$: $2(2x-1)+3(y+1)=18$, cioè $4x+3y=17$; \\ seconda per $6$: $3x-2y=0$, da cui $y=\\tfrac32x$.\r\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    4x+3\\cdot\\dfrac32x &= 17 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{sostituisco}}\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{17}{2}x &= 17\\\\\r\n    x &= 2, \\qquad y=3\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n    \\item Prima per $6$: $3(x+y)+2x=24$, cioè $5x+3y=24$; \\ seconda per $3$: $3x-y=6$, da cui $y=3x-6$.\r\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    5x+3(3x-6) &= 24\\\\\r\n    14x &= 42\\\\\r\n    x &= 3, \\qquad y=3\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n    \\item Prima per $4$: $3x-y+2x=12$, cioè $5x-y=12$; \\ seconda per $4$: $2x-y=0$, da cui $y=2x$.\r\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    5x-2x &= 12 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{sostituisco}}\\\\\r\n    x &= 4, \\qquad y=8\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n    \\item Prima per $6$: $3x-2(y-1)=6$, cioè $3x-2y=4$; \\ seconda per $12$: $4(x+2)-3y=12$, cioè $4x-3y=4$. \\\\\r\n    Riduzione sulla $y$:\r\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    9x-6y &= 12 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{prima per $3$}}\\\\\r\n    8x-6y &= 8 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{seconda per $2$}}\\\\\r\n    x &= 4 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{sottraggo}}\\\\\r\n    2y &= 3\\cdot4-4=8 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; y=4\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "id": 275
