    "text": "Risolvi i seguenti sistemi lineari di due equazioni:\r\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\r\n\\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=3.2cm]\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{2}x+\\dfrac{1}{3}y=5\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{4}x+\\dfrac{1}{3}y=4\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{2}{3}x-\\dfrac{1}{2}y=1\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{2}x+\\dfrac{1}{3}y=5\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{3}{5}x+\\dfrac{1}{2}y=4\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{5}x-\\dfrac{1}{2}y=0\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\r\n    \\item\r\n    \\[\r\n    \\begin{cases}\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{3}x-\\dfrac{2}{5}y=0\\\\\r\n    \\dfrac{1}{2}x+\\dfrac{1}{5}y=4\r\n    \\end{cases}\r\n    \\]\r\n\\end{enumerate}\r\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(4,9)$\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(6,6)$\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(5,2)$\r\n    \\item $(x,y)=(6,5)$\r\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "\\begin{enumerate}\r\n    \\item Prima per $6$: $3x+2y=30$; \\ seconda per $12$: $3x+4y=48$. La $x$ ha lo stesso coefficiente: sottraggo.\r\n    \\[ 2y=18 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; y=9, \\qquad 3x=30-18 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=4 \\]\r\n    \\item Prima per $6$: $4x-3y=6$; \\ seconda per $6$: $3x+2y=30$. Riduzione sulla $y$:\r\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    8x-6y &= 12 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{prima per $2$}}\\\\\r\n    9x+6y &= 90 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{seconda per $3$}}\\\\\r\n    17x &= 102 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{sommo}}\\\\\r\n    x &= 6, \\qquad 3y=4\\cdot6-6=18 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; y=6\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n    \\item Entrambe per $10$: $6x+5y=40$ e $2x-5y=0$. La $y$ ha coefficienti opposti: sommo.\r\n    \\[ 8x=40 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=5, \\qquad 5y=2\\cdot5 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; y=2 \\]\r\n    \\item Prima per $15$: $5x-6y=0$; \\ seconda per $10$: $5x+2y=40$. Sottraggo la prima dalla seconda:\r\n    \\[ 8y=40 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; y=5, \\qquad 5x=6\\cdot5 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=6 \\]\r\n\\end{enumerate}",
