    "text": "Date le funzioni $f(x)=\\dfrac{x+1}{2}$ e $g(x)=x^2-1$, calcola:\r\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\r\n\\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=3.2cm]\r\n    \\item $(f\\circ g)(x)$\r\n    \\item $(g\\circ f)(x)$\r\n    \\item $(f\\circ g)(3)$\r\n    \\item $(g\\circ f)(1)$\r\n    \\item Determina $x$ tale che $(f\\circ g)(x)=8$\r\n    \\item Determina $x$ tale che $(g\\circ f)(x)=6$\r\n\\end{enumerate}\r\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\r\n    \\item $(f\\circ g)(x)=\\dfrac{x^2}{2}$\r\n    \\item $(g\\circ f)(x)=\\dfrac{x^2+2x-3}{4}$\r\n    \\item $\\tfrac92$\r\n    \\item $0$\r\n    \\item $x=\\pm4$\r\n    \\item $x=-1\\pm2\\sqrt7$\r\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "$(f\\circ g)(x)=f\\big(g(x)\\big)$: si calcola prima $g(x)$ e il risultato diventa l'argomento di $f$. In pratica, nell'espressione di $f$ si sostituisce ogni $x$ con l'intera espressione di $g(x)$.\r\n\\begin{enumerate}\r\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    f\\big(g(x)\\big) &= \\dfrac{(x^2-1)+1}{2} && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{al posto di $x$ metto $x^2-1$}}\\\\\r\n    &= \\dfrac{x^2}{2}\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    g\\big(f(x)\\big) &= \\left(\\dfrac{x+1}{2}\\right)^2-1\\\\\r\n    &= \\dfrac{x^2+2x+1}{4}-\\dfrac44 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{quadrato e denominatore comune}}\\\\\r\n    &= \\dfrac{x^2+2x-3}{4}\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n    \\item $(f\\circ g)(3)=\\dfrac{3^2}{2}=\\dfrac92$.\r\n    \\item $f(1)=\\dfrac{1+1}{2}=1$, \\ $g(1)=1-1=0$.\r\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\dfrac{x^2}{2} &= 8\\\\\r\n    x^2 &= 16\\\\\r\n    x &= \\pm4\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\dfrac{x^2+2x-3}{4} &= 6\\\\\r\n    x^2+2x-3 &= 24 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{moltiplico per $4$}}\\\\\r\n    x^2+2x-27 &= 0\\\\\r\n    x &= \\dfrac{-2\\pm\\sqrt{4+108}}{2}=\\dfrac{-2\\pm\\sqrt{112}}{2} && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{formula risolutiva}}\\\\\r\n    x &= \\dfrac{-2\\pm4\\sqrt7}{2}=-1\\pm2\\sqrt7 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{$\\sqrt{112}=\\sqrt{16\\cdot7}=4\\sqrt7$}}\r\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\r\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "id": 336
