    "subtitle": "Calcolo di logaritmi con le proprietà (variante)",
    "text": "Calcola il valore dei seguenti logaritmi usando le opportune proprietà:\n\\begin{center}\\begin{minipage}{0.92\\linewidth}\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\n\\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=3.2cm]\n\\item $\\log_3 27$\n\\item $\\log 20 + \\log 5$\n\\item $\\log_2 \\left(\\dfrac{x^4}{y^2}\\right) \\color{gray}$\n\\item $\\color{gray}\\ln 9e^3 - \\ln e - 2\\ln 3$\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{multicols}\n\\end{minipage}\\end{center}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $3$\n    \\item $2$\n    \\item $4\\log_2x-2\\log_2y$\n    \\item $2$\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "Proprietà dei logaritmi (argomenti positivi): \\ $\\log_a(xy)=\\log_ax+\\log_ay$; \\ $\\log_a\\dfrac xy=\\log_ax-\\log_ay$; \\ $\\log_a x^n=n\\log_ax$; \\ $\\log_a a^n=n$.\n\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $\\log_3 27=\\log_3 3^3=3$.\n    \\item $\\log20+\\log5=\\log100=2$.\n    \\item $\\log_2x^4-\\log_2y^2=4\\log_2x-2\\log_2y$.\n    \\item \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    \\ln9e^3-\\ln e-2\\ln3 &= \\ln9+3-1-\\ln9 && \\textcolor{gray}{\\text{$2\\ln3=\\ln9$}}\\\\\n    &= 2\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n\\end{enumerate}",
