    "subtitle": "Formule di addizione con $\\sin\\alpha=3/5$ e $\\cos\\beta=-8/17$",
    "text": "Sapendo che $\\sin \\alpha = \\dfrac{3}{5}$ e $\\cos \\beta = -\\dfrac{8}{17}$, con $0 < \\alpha < \\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$ e $\\pi < \\beta < \\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}$, calcola:\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item $\\sin(\\alpha + \\beta)$\n\\item $\\cos(\\alpha - \\beta)$\n\\item $\\sin\\dfrac{\\beta}{2}$\n\\item $\\tan\\dfrac{\\alpha}{2}$\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $-\\dfrac{84}{85}$\n    \\item $-\\dfrac{77}{85}$\n    \\item $\\dfrac{5\\sqrt{34}}{34}$\n    \\item $\\dfrac13$\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "Formule: \\ $\\sin(\\alpha\\pm\\beta)=\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta\\pm\\cos\\alpha\\sin\\beta$; \\ $\\cos(\\alpha\\pm\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta\\mp\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$; \\ bisezione $\\sin\\tfrac\\alpha2=\\pm\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1-\\cos\\alpha}{2}}$, $\\cos\\tfrac\\alpha2=\\pm\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1+\\cos\\alpha}{2}}$, $\\tan\\tfrac\\alpha2=\\tfrac{1-\\cos\\alpha}{\\sin\\alpha}$. \\\\\nPrima si ricavano seno e coseno mancanti con $\\sin^2+\\cos^2=1$, scegliendo il segno in base al quadrante; il segno nelle formule di bisezione dipende dal quadrante di $\\tfrac\\alpha2$.\n\\textbf{Funzioni mancanti.}\n\\[ \\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac45 \\ \\ \\text{(I quadrante)}, \\qquad \\sin\\beta=-\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{64}{289}}=-\\dfrac{15}{17} \\ \\ \\text{(III quadrante)} \\]\n\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\tfrac35\\left(-\\tfrac8{17}\\right)+\\tfrac45\\left(-\\tfrac{15}{17}\\right)=\\dfrac{-24-60}{85}=-\\dfrac{84}{85}$.\n    \\item $\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\tfrac45\\left(-\\tfrac8{17}\\right)+\\tfrac35\\left(-\\tfrac{15}{17}\\right)=\\dfrac{-32-45}{85}=-\\dfrac{77}{85}$.\n    \\item $\\tfrac\\pi2<\\tfrac\\beta2<\\tfrac34\\pi$: II quadrante, seno positivo.\n    \\[ \\sin\\dfrac\\beta2=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+\\frac8{17}}{2}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{25}{34}}=\\dfrac{5}{\\sqrt{34}}=\\dfrac{5\\sqrt{34}}{34} \\]\n    \\item $\\tan\\tfrac\\alpha2=\\dfrac{1-\\cos\\alpha}{\\sin\\alpha}=\\dfrac{1-\\frac45}{\\frac35}=\\dfrac13$.\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "id": 627
