    "subtitle": "Equazioni goniometriche elementari",
    "text": "Risolvi le seguenti equazioni:\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item $\\cos x = \\dfrac{1}{2}$\n\\item $\\sin(3x - \\pi/4) = -\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $x=\\pm\\tfrac\\pi3+2k\\pi$\n    \\item $x=\\tfrac23k\\pi \\vee x=\\tfrac\\pi2+\\tfrac23k\\pi$\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "Soluzioni con $k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$. Equazioni elementari: \\ $\\sin\\theta=s \\Rightarrow \\theta=\\theta_0+2k\\pi \\vee \\theta=\\pi-\\theta_0+2k\\pi$; \\ $\\cos\\theta=c \\Rightarrow \\theta=\\pm\\theta_0+2k\\pi$; \\ $\\tan\\theta=t \\Rightarrow \\theta=\\theta_0+k\\pi$. Se l'argomento è un'espressione $\\theta=ax+b$, si risolve prima in $\\theta$ e poi si ricava $x$ (dividendo anche il periodo per $a$).\n\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item Il coseno vale $\\tfrac12$ per $\\pm\\tfrac\\pi3$.\n    \\item $\\sin\\theta=-\\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ per $\\theta=-\\tfrac\\pi4$ e $\\theta=\\pi+\\tfrac\\pi4=\\tfrac54\\pi$.\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    3x-\\dfrac\\pi4 &= -\\dfrac\\pi4+2k\\pi \\;\\Rightarrow\\; 3x=2k\\pi \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=\\dfrac23k\\pi\\\\\n    3x-\\dfrac\\pi4 &= \\dfrac54\\pi+2k\\pi \\;\\Rightarrow\\; 3x=\\dfrac32\\pi+2k\\pi \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=\\dfrac\\pi2+\\dfrac23k\\pi\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n\\end{enumerate}",
