    "subtitle": "Equazioni goniometriche miste — serie 5",
    "text": "Risolvi le seguenti equazioni:\n\\begin{multicols}{2}\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item $\\cos x = 0$\n\\item $\\sin(2x + \\pi/3) = -\\dfrac{1}{2}$\n\\item $\\tan(3x) = \\sqrt{3}$\n\\item $3 \\sin^2 x - 1 = 0$\n\\item $2 \\cos^2 x - \\sin x = 0$\n\\item $\\sin x + 2 \\cos x = 0$\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{multicols}",
    "solution": "\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item $x=\\tfrac\\pi2+k\\pi$\n    \\item $x=-\\tfrac\\pi4+k\\pi \\vee x=\\tfrac5{12}\\pi+k\\pi$\n    \\item $x=\\tfrac\\pi9+k\\tfrac\\pi3$\n    \\item $x=\\pm\\arcsin\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}+k\\pi$ \\ ($\\arcsin\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}\\approx35{,}3^\\circ$)\n    \\item $x=\\arcsin\\tfrac{\\sqrt{17}-1}{4}+2k\\pi \\vee x=\\pi-\\arcsin\\tfrac{\\sqrt{17}-1}{4}+2k\\pi$ \\ ($\\approx51{,}3^\\circ$ e $128{,}7^\\circ$)\n    \\item $x=-\\arctan2+k\\pi$ \\ ($\\arctan2\\approx63{,}4^\\circ$)\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "explanation": "Soluzioni con $k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$. Equazioni elementari: \\ $\\sin\\theta=s \\Rightarrow \\theta=\\theta_0+2k\\pi \\vee \\theta=\\pi-\\theta_0+2k\\pi$; \\ $\\cos\\theta=c \\Rightarrow \\theta=\\pm\\theta_0+2k\\pi$; \\ $\\tan\\theta=t \\Rightarrow \\theta=\\theta_0+k\\pi$. Se l'argomento è un'espressione $\\theta=ax+b$, si risolve prima in $\\theta$ e poi si ricava $x$ (dividendo anche il periodo per $a$).\n\\begin{enumerate}\n    \\item Il coseno si annulla in $\\tfrac\\pi2$ e $\\tfrac32\\pi$, cioè ogni $\\pi$.\n    \\item $\\sin\\theta=-\\tfrac12$ per $\\theta=-\\tfrac\\pi6$ e $\\theta=\\tfrac76\\pi$:\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    2x+\\dfrac\\pi3=-\\dfrac\\pi6+2k\\pi &\\;\\Rightarrow\\; 2x=-\\dfrac\\pi2+2k\\pi \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=-\\dfrac\\pi4+k\\pi\\\\\n    2x+\\dfrac\\pi3=\\dfrac76\\pi+2k\\pi &\\;\\Rightarrow\\; 2x=\\dfrac56\\pi+2k\\pi \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x=\\dfrac5{12}\\pi+k\\pi\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    \\item $3x=\\tfrac\\pi3+k\\pi \\Rightarrow x=\\tfrac\\pi9+k\\tfrac\\pi3$.\n    \\item $\\sin^2x=\\tfrac13 \\Rightarrow \\sin x=\\pm\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt3}=\\pm\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}$. Non è un valore notevole: si usa l'arcoseno. I quattro valori in un giro si raccolgono in $\\pm\\arcsin\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}+k\\pi$.\n    \\item Esprimo tutto in seno con $\\cos^2x=1-\\sin^2x$:\n    \\[\\begin{aligned}\n    2(1-\\sin^2x)-\\sin x &= 0\\\\\n    2\\sin^2x+\\sin x-2 &= 0\\\\\n    \\sin x &= \\dfrac{-1\\pm\\sqrt{17}}{4}\n    \\end{aligned}\\]\n    $\\tfrac{-1-\\sqrt{17}}{4}\\approx-1{,}28<-1$: impossibile. Resta $\\sin x=\\tfrac{\\sqrt{17}-1}{4}\\approx0{,}78$, che ha due soluzioni in un giro (I e II quadrante).\n    \\item $\\cos x=0$ non è soluzione; divido per $\\cos x$: $\\tan x=-2$.\n\\end{enumerate}",
    "id": 642
